Thank you!

To follow up on this, do you recommend significance testing results (with or without p-value correction for repeated testing) or the magnitude of beta estimates to identify items with DIF? I found some previous work uses some criteria to categorize small (<= .05), medium (between 0.05 and 0.1) and large (>.1) DIF based on beta values; however such categorization does not always agree with significance test results. I`d appreciate any guidance on this.

Thanks again!

